        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy TripoSplat- Image to Gaussian Splat\n\nUpload a single 2D image. Generate a high-quality 3D Gaussian splat representation with controllable density and budget for rendering. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs a COMFY_API_KEY.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/3d_triposplat_image_to_gaussian_splat.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
        },
        "ui_properties": {
